1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:03,350
I built Scam Shield thinking about my grandmother.

2
00:00:03,350 --> 00:00:07,200
A rushed parcel notice could catch her off guard.

3
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:14,850
This fictional page demands a tiny fee, card details,
and a decision in thirty minutes.

4
00:00:14,850 --> 00:00:17,920
The pressure is the clue.

5
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:23,550
In the live checker, Firebase AI Logic
flagged that pressure.

6
00:00:23,550 --> 00:00:27,900
Chrome ran the check on this device;
the text stayed in the browser.

7
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:34,150
The extension warns beside the page.

8
00:00:34,800 --> 00:00:36,380
She stays in control.

9
00:00:37,800 --> 00:00:45,200
In one small synthetic run, four of four suspicious pages
were flagged, and none of four ordinary pages falsely flagged.

10
00:00:45,200 --> 00:00:49,000
Real-world accuracy is untested.

11
00:00:50,300 --> 00:00:52,950
Close the page. Open the official delivery app.

12
00:00:52,950 --> 00:00:56,610
Or call a number she already trusts.

13
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:03,600
Try the live checker and inspect the source.

14
00:01:03,600 --> 00:01:07,960
Give someone we love a calm moment
before the next click.
